cted: {pred[0]:.4f} (Class: {int(pred[0]>0.5)})\")"],"execution_count":8,"outputs":[{"output_type":"stream","name":"stdout","text":["Predicted Outputs:\n","Input: [0 0] -> Predicted: 0.0589 (Class: 0)\n","Input: [0 1] -> Predicted: 0.9492 (Class: 1)\n","Input: [1 0] -> Predicted: 0.9496 (Class: 1)\n","Input: [1 1] -> Predicted: 0.0528 (Class: 0)\n"]}]}]}